config BOARD_FRDM_IMX95_SPSDK
	bool "Enable the SPSDK flash runner"
	depends on BOARD_FRDM_IMX95
	help
	  Register the SPSDK runner for west flash. Supply the FRDM BSP
	  bootloader and the assembled AHAB boot container when flashing.
